msgid "\"socks5h://localhost:10808\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/all-settings.md:3095
msgid ""
"If you wish to exclude certain hosts from using the proxy, set the "
"`NO_PROXY` environment variable. This accepts a comma-separated list of "
"hostnames, host suffixes, IPv4/IPv6 addresses or blocks that should not use "
"the proxy. For example if your environment included `NO_PROXY=\"google.com, "
"192.168.1.0/24\"` all hosts in `192.168.1.*`, `google.com` and `*.google."
"com` would bypass the proxy. See [reqwest NoProxy docs](https://docs.rs/"
"reqwest/latest/reqwest/struct.NoProxy.html#method.from_string) for more."
msgstr ""

